    "notes": [
      "After the quest, players can claim a free set of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Deathwarden_robes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">deathwarden robes</a> from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sostratus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sostratus</a> at <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Buried_Bargains\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buried Bargains</a>. If players lose the set, they can purchase it again from Sostratus. Obtaining the set is required to complete <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Kili_Row\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kili Row</a> and upgrade the Necromancy equipment."
